@host = http://localhost:{{port}}

### List users
GET {{host}}/api/users?page=1&limit=20

### Create a user
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "password": "correct-horse-battery"
}

### Update a user (needs a token)
PATCH {{host}}/api/users/REPLACE_WITH_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Ada King"
}

### Liveness — 200 even while draining
GET {{host}}/api/health/liveness

### Readiness — 503 while draining, or if the database is unreachable
GET {{host}}/api/health/readiness
